y manufactured the first 10,000 of them How do you do it? I don't think people understand how many robots there's going to be. Yeah Well, there there's not going to be a window until 10,000 by 2040 You still on that path? that", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/DrageLiten/status/2090566770063208822#t=747", "end": 866.391, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "b31fe8b072693090d3bc2ed2569e13e7248782668597e894eb5b360fb13ea5ae", "start": 747.983, "text": "Yes, I think it will But I don't think it's happening on a short time horizon And also surgery procedures are going to be one of the last things to go The earlier things are going to be more algorithmic decision-making right? It's a lot eas", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/DrageLiten/status/2090566770063208822#t=975", "end": 1085.312, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "efe1ac4dab27cd042304101791ba131d447b75914af110ef64b1053d3cdbfed1", "start": 975.596, "text": "But the robot isn't replacing the ophthalmologist is the one who is doing just about everything from the you know, seeing the patient, assessing, examining et cetera And then for one very small defined task in the procedure you're using a m", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/DrageLiten/status/2090566770063208822#t=0", "end": 77.628, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "c57b4e6c80e29387245c7ca5ea5e23b5c3c30e3f318d025f46e9b149cf082d17", "start": 0.1, "text": "you know a humanoid robot is going to have the same kind of capability as a human but you can probably design some kind of robot that would not have just two eyes or cameras up here and wouldn't just have hands it would have multiple append", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/DrageLiten/status/2090566770063208822#t=142", "end": 261.655, "evidence